n&lt;sub&gt;i&lt;/sub&gt; = ${dpOut.ni.toExponential(2)} cm⁻³&lt;br&gt;
E&lt;sub&gt;F&lt;/sub&gt; − E&lt;sub&gt;Fi&lt;/sub&gt; = &lt;b&gt;${(dpOut.EF - dpOut.EFi).toFixed(3)} eV&lt;/b&gt; · E&lt;sub&gt;c&lt;/sub&gt; − E&lt;sub&gt;F&lt;/sub&gt; = ${(dpOut.Eg - dpOut.EF).toFixed(3)} eV ·
σ = ${dpOut.sigma.toExponential(2)} S/cm (ρ = ${(1/dpOut.sigma).toExponential(2)} Ω cm, Table 3.1 mobilities)
